  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/IMG_6368.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Cafeteria L&#39;Aroma acaba de abir sus puertas al p&uacute;blico en la avenida Montendre de Onda, donde estaba anteriormente el caf&eacute;-bar La Ca&ntilde;a, en la antigua San Miguel, y junto a la parada de autobuses hacia Castell&oacute; y Vila-real, regentada por Corina y Carmen.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6368.jpg\" alt=\"img_6368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6369.jpg\" alt=\"img_6369\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6371.jpg\" alt=\"img_6371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6372.jpg\" alt=\"img_6372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6373.jpg\" alt=\"img_6373\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6374.jpg\" alt=\"img_6374\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6375.jpg\" alt=\"img_6375\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6376.jpg\" alt=\"img_6376\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6378.jpg\" alt=\"img_6378\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialaroma/img_6379.jpg\" alt=\"